  "steps": [
    "Mix besan, salt, red chilli powder, black pepper, jeera powder and water to make a smooth, flowing batter slightly thinner than dosa batter.",
    "Pour the batter onto a hot tawa and spread it into a thin cheela. Sprinkle chopped spinach on top while its wet.",
    "Place a roti or tortilla over the spinach after it slightly cooks, pressing gently. Let it cook, then flip and lightly toast the roti side without making it too crispy.",
    "Flip again so the roti side faces up. Add lettuce, a cheese slice, tomato slices and crumbled high-protein paneer mixed with chilli oil.",
    "Make one cut from the bottom edge towards the centre, creating a quarter-fold opening. Fold the wrap section by section as shown in the video.",
    "Cut the folded wrap in half and enjoy with your favourite sauce or chutney!"
  ],
